        "Name" : "ID Ten Tee",
        "Details" : "You happen to be in the Mech Bay when [[TGT_MW,{TGT_MW.Callsign}]] with  [[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]] in tow both approach Yang with a question. \"Chief?  [[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]] told me that my mech had an ID-10-T recall that you might need to look into.\"\r\n\r\nYang looks at you to make sure you're hearing this, then turns back to {TGT_MW.Callsign} and replies with admirable gravity, \"Wow, this is the first I am hearing about this but I am not all surprised. Usually, it just takes a hard whack with a mallet to service that particular issue with your BattleMech?\"",
