                        "Name" : "stump Yang",
                        "Details" : "You insert yourself into the conversation. \"Hey, that sounds serious! Maybe you should do an audit and inspect the entire MechBay too.\"\r\n\r\nGrabbing the biggest Mallet of the nearby bench, you hand it off to Yang while watching him dead in the eye daring him to take a swing, \"Here you can start with mine.\" \r\n\r\nThat brings Yang up short. His mouth opens, shuts, and opens again. One eye begins twitching until he finally settles on what to say. \"That won't be necessary I am sure we can find a more gentler solution sir.\"\r\n\r\nYou breathe a sigh of relief as Yang starts to chuckle and whisper, \"Be careful what you wish for Commander.\"\r\n\r\n[[TGT_MW,{TGT_MW.Callsign}]] beams with satisfaction, \"Thank you for coming to my rescue Commander. I might be a little shy but I ain't no dummy. Fool me once, shame on you. Fool me twice and, umm....erm\" \r\n\r\nAs they struggle to find their words you jump in blurting, \"You'll kick their ass!\"\r\n\r\n{TGT_MW.Callsign} laughs out loud, nodding in agreement. Thanking you once more as they turn to leave with their teammate. \r\n\r\n\"Looks like they're learning...\", Yang chuckles.\r\n\r\nSmiling you say, \"And not a moment too soon.\"",
