                        "Details" : "[[TGT_MW,{TGT_MW.Callsign}]] quickly interrupts Yang before he can get started. \"Sadly, I believe the problem is an old IBM issue.\"\r\n\r\nYang turns around with a quizzical expression, \"IBM issue?\"\r\n\r\n\"IBM, yes, Idiot Behind Mech and in [[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]]'s case, there is no cure!\"\r\n\r\nYang slaps his thigh with a loud snort. \"That was a good one. Going to add that to my material.\"\r\n\r\n[[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]] turns beat red as {TGT_MW.Callsign} makes a hasty exit while sticking out their tongue.\r\n\r\nWith {SCN_MW.Callsign} in close pursuit, they can be heard echoing throughout the corridor, \"No cure huh? Wait'll I get my hands on you.\"",
